🚨 𝐒𝐜𝐞𝐧𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐨: A Kubernetes node is marked NotReady, and pods are being evicted.

🔍 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐯𝐢𝐞𝐰 𝐐𝐮𝐞𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: How do you identify and resolve the cause?

🧩 𝐑𝐞𝐚𝐥-𝐓𝐢𝐦𝐞 𝐄𝐱𝐚𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐞:

One node in our AWS EKS cluster went NotReady due to disk pressure. The logs showed kubelet failing with node has disk pressure. We cleaned up unused containers and logs. The node recovered and rejoined the cluster.

